        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We now turn to the INDICATOR (5). The button of this DIAL should be in contact with the stop (6). What ever the difference between the first reading which was jotted down and the present reading will constitute the pitch error of the lead screw in thousandths of an inch per foot, either plus or minus.\nSec. 26.73",
