        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "With the lathe completely assembled it is well to try the lathe under actual operating conditions. Up to this point we have depended principally upon a DIAL INDICATOR to inform us as to the accuracy of our alignments. Furthermore, no working pressure has been applied to the bearing surfaces. However, we may feel reasonably certain that the machine will produce accurate work, provided the following conditions were fulfilled, namely:",
